{"kind":"boltworks-plugin-package","packageVersion":1,"manifest":{"kind":"boltworks-plugin","manifestVersion":1,"id":"roblox-exporter","name":"Roblox Exporter","version":"1.1.0","description":"Export one ZIP containing separate OBJ mesh parts, textures, a hierarchy manifest and Roblox Studio assembly scripts. OBJ parts use Roblox studs: 1 stud = 0.28 metres. Receives a model copy only when you choose Send current model.","runtime":"sandbox-html","entry":"main.html","apiVersion":2,"enabled":false,"dependencies":[],"contributes":{"modelSnapshot":true,"exportDownload":true,"exporters":["roblox-pack"]}},"files":{"main.html":{"mediaType":"text/html","data":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"en\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"><title>Roblox Exporter</title><style>:root{color-scheme:dark;font:15px/1.6 \"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:#dce7e8;background:#142125}body{max-width:760px;margin:40px auto;padding:0 24px}h1{font-size:28px}button{font:inherit;color:inherit;background:#22383d;border:1px solid #527078;border-radius:6px;padding:9px 16px;cursor:pointer}button:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:default}.units{border-left:3px solid #40c7a5;padding:12px 18px;background:#192c30}#status{white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;color:#a8d2c9}</style><h1>Roblox Exporter</h1><p>One ZIP containing a separate OBJ for every mesh, your model hierarchy, textures, and Roblox Studio assembly scripts.</p><p class=\"units\">OBJ parts use Roblox stud units. <strong>1 stud = 0.28 metres.</strong></p><ol><li>Choose <strong>Send current model</strong> above to share a copy of every mesh, including hidden parts, its group hierarchy and texture library.</li><li>Build the ZIP below, then choose <strong>Download ZIP</strong> above.</li><li>Import the OBJ files as separate MeshParts in Roblox Studio. Use the included setup script or rebuild plugin to assemble the parts.</li></ol><p>Your BWS workspace is not changed. Send the model again if you e